<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Triton Energy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Triton Energy started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities initiated coverage of Triton Energy Corp with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was trading at 44-3/8, down 3/8, in late morning exchange trading.</p>
